@using DigTionary.Shared.Presentation.Pages.QuestionnaireComponents.Shared
@using DigTionary.Shared.Resources.Translations
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web

@inherits CzToLangBase

<div class="mb-5 p-5">
    <hr />

    <p class="px-1 py-3 w-100">
        <h3 class="fw-bolder">
            @ActualCzechText
        </h3>
    </p>

    @if (IsLastWordShown || CzechPointer < (GeneratedCzechs.Count - 1))
    {
        foreach (var actualWord in ActualWords)
        {
            <div class="border border-dark mb-3 p-3 rounded word-div">
                <span class="fw-bolder">
                    @($"{actualWord.Article ?? string.Empty} {actualWord.Text}".Trim())
                </span>

                @if (actualWord.Notes is string notes)
                {
                    <span>
                        @($"({notes})")
                    </span>
                }

                <span>
                    @($"[{actualWord.Ipa}]")
                </span>
            </div>
        }
    }
    else
    {
        <div
            class="border border-dark button-div d-inline-block p-3 rounded"
            @onclick="ShowWord">
            <Sheet />
        </div>
    }

    <div class="mt-5">
        <button
            class="@NAVIGATION_BUTTON_CLASSES @PreviousWordButtonDisabled"
            @onclick="async () => await ClickPreviousWordButtonAsync()">
            @Localizer[DigTionaryTranslations.Previous]
        </button>

        <button
            class="@NAVIGATION_BUTTON_CLASSES @NextWordButtonDisabled"
            @onclick="async () => await ClickNextWordButtonAsync()">
            @Localizer[DigTionaryTranslations.Next]
        </button>

        <span class="align-middle col-auto fw-bold h1-fixed mb-0 mx-0 text-primary">
            @Done
        </span>
    </div>

    <div class="fw-bolder pt-4">
        <table class="table table-borderless w-auto">
            <tr>
                <td class="text-nowrap">@Localizer[DigTionaryTranslations.WordsViewed]:</td>
                <td class="px-2">@WordsShownCount</td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>

    <Restart />
</div>
